    "title": "<p>Characteristic immunoprofile of binuclear Reed&ndash;Sternberg cells (RSCs) and mononuclear Hodgkin cells (HCs) by immunocytochemistry. The first five markers are the most frequently used as a panel for classic Hodgkin lymphoma (CHL) cases; positivity for both BOB1 and OCT2 is characteristic of the &ldquo;popcorn&rdquo; or lymphocyte-predominant cells of nodular lymphocyte-predominant Hodgkin lymphoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Mousa A. Al-Abbadi",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 510.2pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"680\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Immunomarker</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Characteristic staining</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD30</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive in almost all cases; membranous and Golgi apparatus staining</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD15</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive in 75&ndash;80% of cases; Golgi apparatus staining only</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD45</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in almost all cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD20</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive in 15&ndash;25% of cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">PAX5</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive; weak nuclear staining in 95% of cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD79a</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive in 10% of cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">MUM1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive in 75&ndash;100% of cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">ALK</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">T-cell markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD138</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CD68</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OCT2</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases but can be weakly positive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">BOB1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases but can be weakly positive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pan-epithelial markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pan-mesenchymal markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.45pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"207\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pan-melanoma markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 354.75pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"473\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative in most cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 61144,
